<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Western Digital estimates up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Western Digital estimates up.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised its 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates on Western Digital Corp.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 estimate to $5.16 per share from $4.81.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1998 estimate to $7.02 per share from $6.09.</p>
<p>-- Reiterated buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Tuesday at 58-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
